                                                "sense_id": "b7995621-d644-374a-bb56-b3d2f32bfe79",
                                                "text": "under the cant of a hill"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df3c8bd6-499d-4d57-821f-f4ab04dd4616",
                                                "sense_id": "b7995621-d644-374a-bb56-b3d2f32bfe79",
                                                "text": "The firſt and principall perſon in the temple, vvas IRENE, or Peace; ſhe vvas placed aloft in a Cant, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c1d43dc-ec38-387f-8ef6-c762c8bd581c",
                                        "entry_id": "d2cb4cb8-7b5d-35b9-9351-32c3b9c12a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Slope, the angle at which something is set."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cec80f85-ae76-42d3-a4cd-b8aeb28694fb",
                                                "sense_id": "5c1d43dc-ec38-387f-8ef6-c762c8bd581c",
                                                "text": "Owing to the cant of the vessel, the masts hung far out over the water, and from my perch on the cross-trees I had nothing below me but the surface of the bay."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e38723f4-24ad-3119-b639-56a2b8c3c3b2",
                                        "entry_id": "d2cb4cb8-7b5d-35b9-9351-32c3b9c12a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A corner (of a building)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd861ada-b745-3e98-a43f-0f40b1e3b2d6",
                                        "entry_id": "d2cb4cb8-7b5d-35b9-9351-32c3b9c12a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An outer or external angle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d1985f1-3e08-3200-b9ef-2b4f8393c4da",
                                        "entry_id": "d2cb4cb8-7b5d-35b9-9351-32c3b9c12a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An inclination from a horizontal or vertical line; a slope or bevel; a tilt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88fe0667-89e2-316f-bb57-4f03e494830a",
                                        "entry_id": "d2cb4cb8-7b5d-35b9-9351-32c3b9c12a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A movement or throw that overturns something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac9561eb-78d7-4a3d-a8e7-da071fb64045",
                                                "sense_id": "88fe0667-89e2-316f-bb57-4f03e494830a",
                                                "text": "It is not only of great service in keeping the boat in her due position on the sea, but also in creating a tendency immediately to recover from any sudden cant, or lurch, from a heavy wave; and it is besides beneficial in diminishing the violence of beating against the sides of the vessel which she may go to relieve."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc9cd60a-22c3-3ad9-a7d3-5f03ad70611a",
                                        "entry_id": "d2cb4cb8-7b5d-35b9-9351-32c3b9c12a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sudden thrust, push, kick, or other impulse, producing a bias or change of direction; also, the bias or turn so given."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
